---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { business } from '../data/business';
---

<Layout
  title="Service Terms"
  description="Plain-English terms for quote requests, scheduling, estimates, pricing, and item acceptance from Resolve Junk Solutions."
  crumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { name: 'Terms', url: '/terms' },
  ]}
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">CLEAR EXPECTATIONS</p>
      <h1>Service terms, plainly.</h1>
      <p>How requests, estimates, scheduling, and item acceptance work.</p>
    </section>
    <div class="prose page-content">
      <h2>Requests and appointments</h2>
      <p>
        A request submitted through this website is an inquiry for an estimate,
        not a confirmed appointment or reserved pickup. We will contact you to
        discuss the project. An appointment is confirmed separately.
      </p>
      <h2>Estimates and final pricing</h2>
      <p>
        We communicate and confirm final pricing with you before loading begins.
        Pricing may change if the actual amount or volume, weight, access,
        distance, materials, disposal requirements, or job scope differs from
        the information initially provided. We will discuss any revised price
        with you before proceeding.
      </p>
      <h2>Items and project details</h2>
      <p>
        Please describe the items and conditions accurately, including unusual,
        hazardous, or restricted materials. We may decline items that cannot be
        safely or legally transported or disposed of. Some items may require
        special handling or additional disposal fees. If you are unsure about
        an item, email a photo and description before scheduling.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>
        Contact Resolve Junk Solutions at{' '}
        <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`} data-event="email_click">
          {business.email}
        </a>{' '}
        or <a href={`tel:${business.phoneE164}`} data-event="phone_click">{business.phone}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
